ship the menu item factory interface in ido itself

ubuntu carried this extension point in a patched gtk3 (gtk/ubuntu-private.h),
we don't, so ido grows its own IdoMenuItemFactory interface and the existing
factory implements that instead. consumers walk the menu model themselves and
ask ido_menu_item_factory_get_all() for the widgets.

